      "content": "That makes sense. It feels like we're seeing a massive shift where the old idea of just maximizing short-term profits for shareholders is becoming kind of obsolete because of things like climate change and social pressure. Do you think the companies that ignore these ESG trends are basically just setting themselves up for failure in the modern economy?",
